        "original_id": "602b7000-f8cc-5906-bcf6-1eb04fd1ba28",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Weinstein Company, Dimension Films, The Walt Disney Studios\n- Films: Scary Movie 5, Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD\n- People: Katrina Bowden, Keith Powell, Maulik Pancholy, Tom Broecker, Jonathan Lutz, James Anderson, Sharon Wilkins\n- TV Episodes: Jack the Writer\n\nFacts:\n- Dimension Films is an American film production company and independent film distribution label.\n- Dimension Films was formerly owned by The Walt Disney Studios and is now owned by The Weinstein Company.\n- Katrina Bowden appeared in the films Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, and Scary Movie 5.\n- Katrina Bowden guest starred in the TV episode Jack the Writer alongside Keith Powell, Maulik Pancholy, Tom Broecker, Jonathan Lutz, James Anderson, and Sharon Wilkins.\n- Scary Movie 5 was the second film distributed by The Weinstein Company under the Dimension Films brand.",
